{txt}
{com}. 
. 
. *2)     A study was conducted to determine if smoking and mother's race are associated with birthweight of babies. The data is attached as Regression assignment I Number_2_2025_2026 and the table below contains the details about the variables. Use it to answer the question. Interpret the final model obtained. USE STATA for the analysis
. 
. * Import data
. import excel "data/STATA\Regression assignment I data_Number 2_2025_2026.xlsx", sheet("Sheet1") firstrow
{res}{text}(10 vars, 189 obs)

{com}. 
. * Rename columns 
. rename Column1  id       // Identification code
{res}{txt}
{com}. rename Column2  age      // Age of mother in years
{res}{txt}
{com}. rename Column3  lwt      // Mother's weight at last menstrual period (lbs)
{res}{txt}
{com}. rename Column4  race     // Mother's race (1=White, 2=Black, 3=Other)
{res}{txt}
{com}. rename Column5  smoke    // Smoking during pregnancy (1=Yes, 0=No)
{res}{txt}
{com}. rename Column6  ptl      // History of premature labour
{res}{txt}
{com}. rename Column7  ht       // History of hypertension (1=Yes, 0=No)
{res}{txt}
{com}. rename Column8  ui       // Uterine irritability (1=Yes, 0=No)
{res}{txt}
{com}. rename Column9  ftv      // Physician visits – 1st trimester
{res}{txt}
{com}. rename Column10 bwt      // Birthweight in grams (OUTCOME)
{res}{txt}
{com}. 
. *check to see if renaming was succesful
. bro
{txt}
{com}. 
. *Label columns after renaming
. 
. label variable id    "Identification Code"
{txt}
{com}. label variable age   "Age of the Mother in Years"
{txt}
{com}. label variable lwt   "Weight in Pounds at the Last Menstrual Period"
{txt}
{com}. label variable race  "Mothers Race (1=White, 2=Black, 3=Other)"
{txt}
{com}. label variable smoke "Smoking Status During Pregnancy (1=Yes, 0=No)"
{txt}
{com}. label variable ptl   "History of Premature Labor (0=None, 1=One, etc.)"
{txt}
{com}. label variable ht    "History of Hypertension (1=Yes, 0=No)"
{txt}
{com}. label variable ui    "Presence of Uterine Irritability (1=Yes, 0=No)"
{txt}
{com}. label variable ftv   "Number of Physician Visits During First Trimester"
{txt}
{com}. label variable bwt   "Birth Weight in Grams"
{txt}
{com}. 
. *Data inspection
. bro
{txt}
{com}. 
. *ptl and ftv have levels with sparse categories
. 
. tab ptl

